ShortDescription: Go from an empty computer to a reproducible LaTeX paper.
Description: >-
  texe creates, builds, watches, and diagnoses LaTeX papers using a
  checksummed project-managed toolchain. It includes the compatible pqty and
  pqty-fls commands and does not require a system TeX Live installation.
